<DocsLayout title="Retry Policy — Exponential Backoff | Echophi Docs" description="How Echophi retries failed webhook deliveries with exponential backoff.">
  <h1>Retry policy</h1>
  <p>
    Outbox delivery retries on transport / non-2xx failures. Inspect attempts under Recent Deliveries (
    <code>attempts</code>, <code>last_error</code>, <code>latency_ms</code>). There is no Partner-facing replay
    inbox in v1 — fix your receiver and wait for the next event, or use Test.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
